              <ownedComment xmi:id="20ca3594-3fc0-4f98-9c41-868ac3a69b58" body="This immutable class specifies the set of domain parameters&#xA;used with elliptic curve cryptography (ECC).&#xA;&#xA;@see AlgorithmParameterSpec&#xA;&#xA;@author Valerie Peng&#xA;@version 1.3, 12/19/03&#xA;&#xA;@since 1.5&#xA;" annotatedElement="2a43b191-81e8-456c-a22b-1a4e043ba622"/>
