              <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="e12cfea8-1f06-4ad2-af2f-f4c050d07540" name="AtomicMarkableReference">
                <ownedComment xmi:id="9ebbbdbe-9733-4739-8b49-d3cbc6633443" body="An &lt;tt>AtomicMarkableReference&lt;/tt> maintains an object reference&#xA;along with a mark bit, that can be updated atomically.&#xA;&lt;p>&#xA;&lt;p> Implementation note. This implementation maintains markable&#xA;references by creating internal objects representing &quot;boxed&quot;&#xA;[reference, boolean] pairs.&#xA;&#xA;@since 1.5&#xA;@author Doug Lea&#xA;@param &lt;V> The type of object referred to by this reference&#xA;" annotatedElement="e12cfea8-1f06-4ad2-af2f-f4c050d07540"/>
