              <ownedComment xmi:id="6e626c68-6d26-4463-a079-4db334a4b6fa" body="A better GridLayout class&#xA;&#xA;@version 1.8 12/19/03&#xA;@author Steve Wilson&#xA;" annotatedElement="a5abbf05-1c6a-4dab-9a02-328c7ba20cf2"/>
