                <ownedComment xmi:id="8692faeb-4a42-4be9-9ff4-7c9b1d74b709" body="This class implements accessibility support for the&#xA;&lt;code>JTree&lt;/code> child.  It provides an implementation of the&#xA;Java Accessibility API appropriate to tree nodes.&#xA;" annotatedElement="93f03327-c7fa-4c02-8f9d-158f1c94a420"/>
