                  <ownedComment xmi:id="2b53ac86-ed30-40ce-804b-37e926b6683a" body="Pass the name String to the super constructor. This is used&#xA;later to identify the Action and decide whether to play it or&#xA;not. Store the resource String. I is used to get the audio&#xA;resource. In this case, the resource is an audio file.&#xA;&#xA;@since 1.4&#xA;" annotatedElement="0b57c0c6-98ee-41fc-bd8a-1e07c2f9019a"/>
