                  <ownedComment xmi:id="8b0e39d8-0b27-4910-999a-319382b627d9" body="As of Java 2 platform 1.4, this previously undocumented class&#xA;is now obsolete. KeyBindings are now managed by the popup menu.&#xA;" annotatedElement="4ffa8906-82af-4ccc-ab53-842b5f6cc92d"/>
