                  <ownedComment xmi:id="ee85f519-6ce9-42b8-ae7a-2b940725cc78" body="As of 1.4, this class is now obsolete, doesn't do anything, and&#xA;is only included for backwards API compatibility. Do not call or&#xA;override.&#xA;&lt;p>&#xA;The functionality has been migrated into &lt;code>ItemHandler&lt;/code>.&#xA;&#xA;@see #createItemListener&#xA;" annotatedElement="b8bc3f04-476f-4e46-befb-882db676f0ba"/>
